# No screenshots

Sensitive screens (especially student QR codes) must never appear in a device screenshot, app switcher snapshot, or print capture. If a user captures the screen on phone or desktop, the capture must be black.

## Required behavior

- Keep `ScreenGuard` mounted in `app/layout.js`. Do not remove it.
- Black out only when the tab is hidden, on print, or on Print Screen / Mac capture keys. Do not black out on window `blur` or 3-finger taps — those fire during normal use.
- QR codes stay inside `.secure-qr` with the shield overlay. Never allow long-press save, copy, or drag of the QR.
- Do not add screenshot, download-QR, or share-image features.

```js
// ❌ BAD
<img src={qrPng} alt="QR" />
<button onClick={downloadQr}>Save QR</button>

// ✅ GOOD
<div className="secure-qr">
  <QRCode value={student.id} />
  <div className="secure-qr-shield" />
</div>
```
